s' appears below the emoji in sans-serif text\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:46b2973da08be59e1ec5eb48df002a26301315b975b937db4903f00da0d22a8f","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md:fragment:sha256:46b2973da08be59e1ec5eb48df002a26301315b975b937db4903f00da0d22a8f:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:331ea3c9c2a6b88ed96618247922be44c114d9cdc3f0f1680f785841557f0488","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["935cc16a-f415-1e20-19ba-7b8e59cb9b59"],"startLine":32},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":8,"exactText":"One page tracks time today. A person types what they are working on, picks a project from a short list, starts a timer and stops it. Today's entries show in a list with each duration and the day's total. A person can add an entry by hand with a duration, edit an entry, and delete one with an undo. Entries stay after a reload. The page keeps the egg emoji and the word 'Eggs' from the egg page as a centered header.","exactTextDigest":"sha256:82bfc415930ebd97e95d3b8cd68df2c80ece9de06938aac7b7a88a7752ab80a7","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:82bfc415930ebd97e95d3b8cd68df2c80ece9de06938aac7b7a88a7752ab80a7:sha256:10d593a64a90150f8152057c9809a4ee9b3633c3cba7f72637872e2fcf569e65:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:82bfc415930ebd97e95d3b8cd68df2c80ece9de06938aac7b7a88a7752ab80a7","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["3c25b24f-9571-00d5-afe5-64e0eb342f88"],"startLine":8},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":14,"exactText":"- **AC1 —** The header shows one egg emoji and the word 'Eggs'. _(Scenario: \"Eggs header\")_","exactTextDigest":"sha256:3100cf34a781c66a3dd4a433d5e522744ea7f957d0a038c2bc9e3e55aad8e633