b801c90553c81dab8ac99b19f1f84db2b9229fcf0046c549","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["71d0d1f6-5580-22bf-7725-384c26bf20ea","92a75a95-5fec-f59a-1eb9-729e47df59d6","ff2e7313-15de-9173-ad0c-f2f7e42197f6"],"startLine":28},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":38,"exactText":"Scenario: Eggs header\nGiven the page loads\nWhen no further action is taken\nThen one egg emoji and the word 'Eggs' appear together as the page header\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:32c6fbc37d1aa8080d5b4fead3aa7071aa04d4390d3e243a0b8bad1d52e87ed2","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:32c6fbc37d1aa8080d5b4fead3aa7071aa04d4390d3e243a0b8bad1d52e87ed2:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:1fed5b75ff9500860c6c8719b59e834b38be4e5b1127dab233ca22f2ee076f05","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["3c25b24f-9571-00d5-afe5-64e0eb342f88"],"startLine":35},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":47,"exactText":"Scenario: Start a typed entry\nGiven today's list is empty\nWhen the person types what they are working on and starts the timer\nThen Admin is chosen first for the entry\nAnd the entry shows the typed work\nAnd the entry appears with a running timer\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:6c2ca0442c71e2596b9e120205db849f692dd927f598a0ecb1d763d7ba536d8b","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:6c2ca0442c71e2596b9e120205db849f692dd927f598a0ecb1d763d7ba536d8b:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:4c2c7d46e9bd198c693e35b4712886e32c3cef9a05a9c7977dba80d3f713b4cf","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["85306f2e-a173-5919-119b-b6e00cfbca9b"],"startLine":42},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":54,"exactText":"Scenario: Pick a project for an entry\nGiven an entry exists with Admin chosen\nWhen the person picks Client work from the short list\nThen the entry shows Client work\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:45609e439d7db79d54d025618b8820f8aefafeb1879686a72e83403f3005eae7","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:45609e439d7db79d54d025618b8820f8aefafeb1879686a72e83403f3005eae7:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:f6b91c6adb4c1ffc59d7f045561bad0be86daf43955fd1d12ea40f3bd91d3ba3","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["d6dfcbb8-dae6-406b-43d9-14172a2db25d"],"startLine":51},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":62,"exactText":"Scenario: Start and stop a timer\nGiven an entry shows a running timer\nWhen the person stops the timer\nThen the entry shows a duration equal to the elapsed time between starting and stopping\nAnd the timer no longer runs\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:7c0860dfffd1dd883dc2bbd26c54896c012cd8758403941ae1d0c5fc433499be","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:7c0860dfffd1dd883dc2bbd26c54896c012cd8758403941ae1d0c5fc433499be:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:8e6938c66d02195f4a472df2df33a6a85199982e7f0526e42ff09fb2e77036f6","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["8e46565d-b950-21db-6850-851572d72865"],"startLine":58},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":70,"exactText":"Scenario: List today's entries and the day's total\nGiven two entries exist for today\nWhen the page loads\nThen the list shows each entry with its duration\nAnd the day's total equals the sum of the entries' durations\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:150a259eb5945ca0dbe615e6466d7f082abe2431fc054de30c1a542627a02dd2","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:150a259eb5945ca0dbe615e6466d7f082abe2431fc054de30c1a542627a02dd2:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:74ee345985080708dd2f3fee689a07e81d6e3435c10ab87f7bfc92384b7ac502","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["fd98104a-08ac-b9af-8834-5d69c3142d39"],"startLine":66},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":77,"exactText":"Scenario: Add an entry by hand\nGiven today's list is empty\nWhen the person adds an entry by hand with a duration\nThen the entry appears in today's list with that duration\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:5264f5cb3eafb8500f85099bdf09afb146d2bb3be63633232ad67e633a1a64a2","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:5264f5cb3eafb8500f85099bdf09afb146d2bb3be63633232ad67e633a1a64a2:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:5ee05357625eaa9ecaadaaf93334019330672101e4cf5d699021fdaaa5c40a8d","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["92a75a95-5fec-f59a-1eb9-729e47df59d6"],"startLine":74},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":84,"exactText":"Scenario: Edit an entry\nGiven an entry exists\nWhen the person edits its work and its duration\nThen the entry shows the escaped edited work and duration\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:929735071d6be5dfcb855205a9223307fbac789c569fafd37b43af0f26591a77","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:929735071d6be5dfcb855205a9223307fbac789c569fafd37b43af0f26591a77:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:ec4430bf06cc36894674940bdfdf9fbad5c9c4b635948435851525a8013e9211","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["d4367368-bc39-31a1-bd12-52153f1ad57c"],"startLine":81},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":94,"exactText":"Scenario: Delete an entry with undo\nGiven an entry exists for today\nWhen the person deletes the entry\nThen the entry is removed from today's list\nAnd an undo appears and is announced to screen readers and reachable by keyboard\nWhen the person chooses undo\nThen the entry reappears in today's list\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:8be6b60ed0a667889afc843e65e21485c0ac8fff559a467af8ea0ba4945a59ba","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:8be6b60ed0a667889afc843e65e21485c0ac8fff559a467af8ea0ba4945a59ba:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:569040ad37f8a92c23476cb763926455296bb0b8f77eebc126d73b9a183ec3da","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["6a74625f-b654-42ff-f155-8decefdfcf57"],"startLine":88},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","endLine":101,"exactText":"Scenario: Entries stay after a reload\nGiven an entry exists for today\nWhen the page reloads\nThen the entry still appears with its work, its project and its duration\n","exactTextDigest":"sha256:ba58fd96475b16884ef3e89f4e39133284b5e94380fe976b401c685027e8a8f7","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md:fragment:sha256:ba58fd96475b16884ef3e89f4e39133284b5e94380fe976b401c685027e8a8f7:sha256:2a6ba5f01d279185195b2bd053368c910ce91be4948f14c4ee16622deadf3e45:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:e3183dd81e493b211cf05827d7fae6bfd8c2234e9339b66b521ba9dc18c4a017","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","requirementIdentities":["cde5467c-b127-8a17-e7f5-42b4b7d21704"],"startLine":98},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.tech.md","endLine":5,"exactText":"Eggs adopts the `eggs-web` blueprint.","exactTextDigest":"sha256:f0761ab54f00f88ca0eef45398630bceaa615630d18183be3c5669c530a1d67e","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.tech.md:fragment:sha256:f0761ab54f00f88ca0eef45398630bceaa615630d18183be3c5669c530a1d67e:sha256:e0974f1cc00006213640bb16b1eb0ffa017d82b47c65caa7f0dd852593989a68:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:f0761ab54f00f88ca0eef45398630bceaa615630d18183be3c5669c530a1d67e","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.tech.md","requirementIdentities":["b30e430d-880c-ab7a-0a3a-bf2929413654"],"startLine":5},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.tech.md","endLine":9,"exactText":"Each end-to-end test takes a screenshot of its outcome.","exactTextDigest":"sha256:78b1dd256186c74c1c8b2b7282106434bcbaa4d3383f131d98a733c51b93e1c9","fragmentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.tech.md:fragment:sha256:78b1dd256186c74c1c8b2b7282106434bcbaa4d3383f131d98a733c51b93e1c9:sha256:7679d99a9483007bed6e4eb34549151c1ad298a251aab01b64ba71771ebdbc16:0of1","normalizedFragmentDigest":"sha256:78b1dd256186c74c1c8b2b7282106434bcbaa4d3383f131d98a733c51b93e1c9","repositoryRelativePath":"docs/specs/time-today/time-today.tech.md","requirementIdentities":["e6342065-61ba-f79d-53c1-93e75d8e4b92"],"startLine":9}],"specificationIntents":[{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/egg-page/egg-page.spec.md","purpose":"# Feature\n\nA page shows one egg emoji in the middle. Below it, the word 'Eggs' appears in sans-serif text.\n\n# Intention & objectives\n\nThe page lets a visitor see an egg emoji centered on the screen. The word 'Eggs' sits under it in a plain sans-serif typeface."},{"documentIdentity":"specification:docs/specs/time-today/time-today.spec.md","purpose":"# Feature\n\nOne page tracks time today. A person types what they are working on, picks a project from a short list, starts a timer and stops it. Today's entries show in a list with each duration and the day's total. A person can add an entry by hand with a duration, edit an entry, and delete one with an undo. Entries stay after a reload. The page keeps the egg emoji and the word 'Eggs' from the egg page as a centered header.\n\n# Intention & objectives\n\nA person who bills by the hour records where their day goes while they work, so the hours are right when they bill or report them later. This first slice proves the core loop for one day: start, stop, correct and total. Projects, clients, weeks and reports come in later slices."}],"targetRevision":"sha256:317dac65c9e3f4fe80593562a095326eabdde93b79856afb5b213c4fbcaf845c"},"schema":"axiom.desired-state-instruction-package","schemaVersion":8,"verificationArtifactRevision":"sha256:61cdee27931cb96365b3dc6dab2fa3d354e4ecfc5ff57639bf1887a8c27a7e9b","verificationAssignments":[{"authorityArtifactRevision":"sha256:61cdee27931cb96365b3dc6dab2fa3d354e4ecfc5ff57639bf1887a8c27a7e9b","evidenceIdentities":["invariant-assumed-deterministic-check:v1:3c25b24f-9571-00d5-afe5-64e0eb342f88"],"mechanism":"deterministic_check","requirementIdentity":"3c25b24f-9571-00d5-afe5-64e0eb342f88"},{"authorityArtifactRevision":"sha256:61cdee27931cb96365b3dc6dab2fa3d354e4ecfc5ff57639bf1887a8c27a7e9b","evidenceIdentities":["invariant-assumed-deterministic-check:v1:6a74625f-b654-42ff-f155-8decefdfcf57"],"mechanism":"deterministic_check","requirementIdentity":"6a74625f-b654-42ff-f155-8decefdfcf57"},{"authorityArtifactRevision":"sha256:61cdee27931cb96365b3dc6dab2fa3d354e4ecfc5ff57639bf1887a8c27a7e9b","evidenceIdentities":["invariant-assumed-deterministic-check:v1:71d0d1f6-5580-22bf-7725-384c26bf20ea"],"mechanism